{"v":1,"id":"sika-dilatec-br-500","n":"Sika Dilatec BR-500","b":"Sika","u":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/waterproofing/66807/sika-dilatec-br-500.html","c":"construction/waterproofing/66807","d":{"t":"PVC multifunctional sealing tape for PVC and bitumuminous membranes","s":"Sika Dilatec BR-500 is a flexible waterproofing tape based on polyvinyl chloride (PVC) with advanced adhesion properties. The tape terminates and connects bituminous waterproofing membranes to Sikaplan WP (PVC) sheet membranes. The B-edge on one side is bonded to the bituminous membranes with hot-melt bitumen. The R-edge on the other side is hot air welded to the Sikaplan WP membranes. Thickness 1,6 mm. Part of the Sika Dilatec joint sealing system.","a":["Multifunctional solution for sealing bituminous membrane to PVC membrane","Good adhesion properties","No activation on site required","High flexibility and joint bridging ability","Good chemical resistance","Resistant to weathering","Root penetration resistant","Hot air weldable","Adaptable to many different jointing situations"],"us":["Sealing of different structures and applications including:","Bridges","Basements","Cut and cover tunnels","Sealing of:","Connections between adjoining bituminous and PVC waterproofing membranes","Construction joints"],"pk":"1 roll of 30 m length Refer to current price list for packaging variations","sec":[{"l":"APPROVALS / CERTIFICATES","t":"Elongation, Tensile Strength, Foldability, Puncture and Tear Resistance tests, Sika Dilatec BR-500, tecnotest ag, Test report No. A4447-01 Fire Testing EN ISO 11925, Sika Dilatec BR-500, tecnotest ag, Test report No. A4020-08","g":"Sustainability / Certifications / Approvals"},{"l":"Composition","t":"PVC, bitumen compatible (PVC-P-BV)","g":"Product Information"},{"l":"Shelf life","t":"36 months from date of production","g":"Product Information"},{"l":"Storage conditions","t":"The product must be stored in original, unopened and undamaged sealed packaging in dry condi